==History==
2016
*The Three Musketeers [[Cards|card]] was added to the game on 29/2/2016, in the [[Version History#March 2016 Update (29/2/2016)|March 2016 Update]].
*On 23/3/2016, a [[Version History#Balance Changes (23/3/2016)|Balance Update]], decreased the Three Musketeers' cost to 9 [[Elixir]] (from 10 Elixir).
*On 3/5/2016, the [[Version History#May 2016 Update (3/5/2016)|May 2016 Update]], increased the {{Rarity|Rare}} card Level cap to 11 (from 10) and fixed the "range bug", decreasing the Three Musketeers' range to 6 tiles (from 6.5 tiles), but their effective range was unchanged.
2018
*On 5/9/2018, the [[Version History#September%202018%20Update%20(5/9/2018)|September 2018 Update]], changed it so that {{Rarity|Rare}} cards start at Level 3 and end at Level 13 (from 1 to 11).
2019
*On 4/2/2019, a [[Version History#Balance Changes (4/2/2019)|Balance Update]], increased the Three Musketeers' cost to 10 Elixir (from 9 Elixir), but also increased the Musketeers' damage by 3%.
*On 13/2/2019, an [[Version History#Optional%20Update%20(13/2/2019)|Optional Update]], made it so that [[Mirror|mirroring]] Three Musketeers would no longer display the cost of 11 Elixir.
*On 6/5/2019, a [[Version History#Balance Changes (6/5/2019)|Balance Update]], decreased the Three Musketeers' cost to 9 Elixir (from 10 Elixir), but also increased their deploy time to 3 seconds (from 1 second) and added a 0.15 second deploy time between each Musketeer.
*On 1/7/2019, the [[Version History#July%202019%20Update%20(1/7/2019)|July 2019 Update]], removed the Three Musketeers from all [[Tournament/Special Event Challenges|Draft]] selections.
*On 26/11/2019, the [[Version History#End%20of%20November%202019%20Update%20(26/11/2019)|End of November 2019 Update]], removed the Three Musketeers from [[Touchdown]] Draft.
*On 2/12/2019, a [[Version History#Pass Royale and more (2/12/2019)|Balance Update]], decreased the Three Musketeers' deploy time to 2 seconds (from 3 seconds) and increased the deploy stagger for each Musketeer to 0.5 seconds (from 0.15 seconds).
2020
*On 2/6/2020, a [[Version History#Balance Changes (2/6/2020)|Balance Update]], decreased the deploy stagger for each Musketeer to 0.1 seconds (from 0.5 seconds).
*On 31/8/2020, the [[Version History#Clan%20Wars%20II%20Update%20(31/8/2020)|Clan Wars II Update]], added a card render to the Three Musketeers' card info screen.
*On 6/10/2020, a [[Version History#Balance Changes (6/10/2020)|Balance Update]], increased the Musketeers' first attack time interval to 0.8 seconds (from 0.5 seconds).
2021
*On 30/3/2021, the [[Version History#2021%20Quarter%201%20Update%20(30/3/2021)|2021 Quarter 1 Update]], decreased the Three Musketeers' deploy time to 1 second (from 2 seconds).
*On 27/10/2021, the [[Version History#Champions%20Update%20(27/10/2021)|Champions Update]], increased the Level cap of all cards to 14 (from 13).
2022
*On 3/2/2022, a [[Version History#Maintenance Break (3/2/2022)|maintenance break]], decreased the Musketeers' attack time interval to 1 second (from 1.1 seconds).
2023
*On 19/6/2023, the [[Version History#Card%20Evolution%20Update%20(19/6/2023)|Card Evolution Update]], increased the Level cap of all cards to 15 (from 14).
2025
*On 4/2/2025, a [[Version History#Balance Changes (4/2/2025)|Balance Update]], decreased the Musketeers' first attack time interval to 0.7 seconds (from 0.8 seconds).
*On 31/3/2025, the [[Version History#2025 Quarter 1 Update (31/3/2025)|2025 Quarter 1 Update]], decreased the Musketeers' hitpoints by 0.06%, and their damage by 0.45%. It also made it so that Three Musketeers' spawn formation would be correctly mirrored depending on which side of the [[Arenas|Arena]] they were placed.
*On 3/11/2025, a [[Version History#November (11) 2025|Balance Update]], reworked the Three Musketeers so that it now spawns three different troops called "Elite Musketeers" that have different damage statistics from the Musketeer and a melee attack. It also changed the description of the card. It used to read ''“Trio of powerful, independent markswomen, fighting for justice and honor. Disrespecting them would not be just a mistake, it would be a cardinal sin!”''
*On 1/12/2025, a Balance Update improved the Three Musketeers' targeting and added a 0.1 second deploy stagger.
2026

* On 2/2/2026, increased attack speed to 1.2 seconds (from 1.3 seconds).

